flowchart LR
  U[User]

  subgraph M[Flutter Mobile App]
    UI[UI Layer<br>Add Food / Log / Analysis]
    ST[State Layer<br>Riverpod Providers]
    LC[Local Cache<br>StorageService]
  end

  subgraph E[Edge API Layer]
    EF[Edge Function<br>analyze-meal]
    JV[JWT Auth Validation]
  end

  subgraph A[AI Provider]
    GM[Gemini Multimodal Model]
  end

  subgraph D[Data Layer]
    OS[(Object Storage<br>meal-images private bucket)]
    UP[(user_profiles)]
    BM[(body_metrics)]
    MR[(meal_records)]
    AA[(ai_meal_analyses)]
    QA[(quick_add_items)]
  end

  U -->|Capture or upload photo| UI
  UI --> ST
  ST <--> LC

  UI -->|Upload image| OS
  UI -->|Invoke analyze-meal<br>image_path + date + JWT| EF
  EF --> JV
