  EF -->|Prompt + response schema| GM
  GM -->|Structured JSON result| EF
  EF -->|analysis_id + items + totals| UI

  UI -->|User reviews AI result<br>confirm or edit| UI
  UI -->|Save meal record| MR
  UI -->|Save AI feedback| AA
  AA -->|Link meal_record_id| MR

  UI -->|Profile update| UP
  UI -->|Daily check-in| BM
  UI -->|Quick add CRUD| QA